#### [Health](/subject/health/)

Dehydration is bad, and electrolytes are important. Sports drinks replace essential ions lost through sweat – but is that all just marketing hype?

By [James Witts](/author/james-witts/)

10 January 2018

[Facebook / Meta](https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.newscientist.com%2Farticle%2Fmg23731601-200-no-sweat-are-sports-drinks-worth-the-money%2F)
[Twitter / X icon](https://twitter.com/share?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.newscientist.com%2Farticle%2Fmg23731601-200-no-sweat-are-sports-drinks-worth-the-money%2F)

